# AICL Example: Traffic Light
# AX sub-language — compiles to real code.

Goal:
Action

Layer:
Core

Behavior Action
    Input: color
    Output: result
    Action:
        if color == "red":
            return "stop"
        elif color == "yellow":
            return "slow"
        elif color == "green":
            return "go"
        return "invalid"
